 "_comment": "Stepping stones for long walks (behaviours/navigation/TravelHubs.PlayerBots.js): hubs are towns and crossroads [x, y]; links [a, b, tiles] are walks between two hubs that the route planner found in game (tiles: the walk's length). A walk too long to plan in one go goes hub to hub along these links. Add a hub with its links (checked with the agent MCP's plan_route) to open up a part of the map. lockedAreas: parts of the map behind a quest [minX, minY, maxX, maxY]; a bot goes there only with that quest done, or carrying that item (item: a Shantay pass for the desert). enterVia: the hubs inside the area a walk goes in from (Morytania: past the Salve only through Paterdomus to Canifis); the last leg into the area starts at one of them. onFoot: false: not on foot at all (an island), only by teleport. area: one [minX, minY, maxX, maxY] or a list of them. boats: NPC ferries (plugins/agent/data/transports.json boats; PiratesTreasure.Quest.js, BarnabyFerry.plugin.js) from a dock to a dock, with the NPC's options and the fare; an area with byBoat is reached through them (Adventurers.walkTo).",
